WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.878
- [Adam Lefkoe:] Was D'Andre Swift underrated?
Underneath the star.

00:00:04.295 --> 00:00:07.257
Can he get the star?
[Dramatic instrumental music]

00:00:08.591 --> 00:00:09.551
Be a star,

00:00:09.551 --> 00:00:12.262
D'Andre!

00:00:15.265 --> 00:00:16.558
Welcome to "Underrated,"

00:00:16.558 --> 00:00:21.229
the only show where professional athletes
get to improve their video game ratings.

00:00:21.229 --> 00:00:26.776
And today we have the scintillating,
the super, the spectacular D'Andre

00:00:26.776 --> 00:00:30.238
Swift of the Detroit Lions.

00:00:35.618 --> 00:00:37.287
I'm watching you last year.

00:00:37.287 --> 00:00:39.122
You can run faster than anybody.

00:00:39.122 --> 00:00:41.124
You can catch better than anybody.

00:00:41.124 --> 00:00:42.417
How is the gun, though?

00:00:42.417 --> 00:00:44.669
How is the arm?
What kinda throwing do we have?

00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:46.713
- I got an arm.
- You do?

00:00:47.005 --> 00:00:49.215
- I got an arm. I do have an arm. Yeah, I do.
- OK. I looked it up.

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:51.384
You had one throw with the Lions.

00:00:51.384 --> 00:00:53.636
You had one throw in college.

00:00:53.636 --> 00:00:55.472
How many of those did you complete?

00:00:55.472 --> 00:00:57.140
- Zero.
- Yes.
- [Laughing]

00:00:57.348 --> 00:00:59.434
- Do you know your Madden ratings
for throwing?

00:00:59.434 --> 00:01:02.187
- I don't. What is it?
- OK. I'm gonna tell you.
- OK.

00:01:02.187 --> 00:01:03.396
- But I have the plug.

00:01:03.396 --> 00:01:05.607
I brought him here to boost your ratings.

00:01:05.982 --> 00:01:08.568
Let's get Clint in here. Clint?

00:01:14.699 --> 00:01:14.866
Look how

00:01:14.866 --> 00:01:17.077
official he is.
- Pure business.

00:01:17.577 --> 00:01:18.745
- This is the Madden

00:01:18.745 --> 00:01:20.872
Ratings Adjustor.
- Look like it.
- He said "Goodness!"

00:01:21.456 --> 00:01:24.959
What do you think your short
throw accuracy is?

00:01:25.251 --> 00:01:28.338
- Probably like a 50.
- A 50?
- Fifty.

00:01:28.338 --> 00:01:31.674
- Clint, what is he?
- It's a 30.
- It's a 30? OK, OK.

00:01:31.716 --> 00:01:34.010
- He looked that way
cuz he didn't want to believe it.

00:01:34.385 --> 00:01:38.306
- [Clint:] So he's actually tied at 53rd
among all NFL running backs.

00:01:38.306 --> 00:01:40.767
- 53rd? We need to change that.
We need to change that.

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:42.894
- We need to change that.
- Let's see what we got today.

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:44.395
- So you need to see accuracy today.

00:01:44.395 --> 00:01:45.438
- I need to see accuracy.

00:01:45.438 --> 00:01:46.189
- OK.

00:01:46.189 --> 00:01:49.692
Are you ready to show him
what it takes to boost that rating?

00:01:49.692 --> 00:01:51.569
- I'm ready to show you. I'm ready.

00:01:51.569 --> 00:01:53.196
- Yeah.
- All right. Good luck. Show us what you got.

00:01:53.196 --> 00:01:54.739
- Yes, sir.

00:01:54.739 --> 00:01:58.409
[Upbeat bass music]

00:01:59.327 --> 00:02:01.538
- All right, D'Andre,
we have a two-minute drill set up.

00:02:01.538 --> 00:02:05.750
We got pinatas about five yards deep.
[Electronic pinging]

00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:07.836
You hit one, you keep moving.

00:02:07.919 --> 00:02:10.171
The more you hit,
the more your rating goes up.

00:02:10.338 --> 00:02:11.664
So whenever you're ready.

00:02:13.716 --> 00:02:15.176
He's goin' for the pig.

00:02:15.802 --> 00:02:17.512
Gettin' his bearing.

00:02:19.097 --> 00:02:20.306
Bang!

00:02:24.269 --> 00:02:25.562
Next one.

00:02:26.187 --> 00:02:28.565
Now the donkey. Drills the donkey,

00:02:28.565 --> 00:02:30.483
and he opens him in half!

00:02:34.237 --> 00:02:37.407
The unicorn. Boom!

00:02:37.407 --> 00:02:39.159
Open him up.

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:46.791
- [Clint:] Just throw it out.

00:02:46.958 --> 00:02:49.544
- [Lefkoe:] He hit Shamu in the fin.

00:02:51.588 --> 00:02:54.591
Underneath the star. Can he get the star?

00:02:54.674 --> 00:02:56.885
He can't hit this star.

00:03:00.388 --> 00:03:02.932
Be a star, D'Andre!

00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:06.853
All right, now he's moving down to the cowboy boot.

00:03:07.979 --> 00:03:10.732
- He's throwin' right. He's goin' right.
- Right on the boot.

00:03:10.899 --> 00:03:13.026
- [Clint:] There he goes.
- [Lefkoe:] Whew, and he opens the boot.

00:03:13.026 --> 00:03:15.904
And now it is just the T. rex.

00:03:15.904 --> 00:03:18.364
Drills Tyrannosaurus rex!

00:03:21.868 --> 00:03:23.953
We have moved our way down the field.

00:03:23.953 --> 00:03:25.496
You cannot miss in the red zone.

00:03:25.496 --> 00:03:26.998
You're goin' for the Tiki Man.

00:03:26.998 --> 00:03:29.125
I want explosions.

00:03:32.545 --> 00:03:36.925
Ooh! First hit! Made his way down the field.

00:03:37.175 --> 00:03:38.051
Got it done.

00:03:38.051 --> 00:03:40.887
Tiki Man exploded.
How did it feel overall?

00:03:40.887 --> 00:03:41.429
- [Swift:] Felt good.

00:03:41.429 --> 00:03:44.182
Had to get warmed up a little bit,
but once I got going, it was good.

00:03:44.515 --> 00:03:46.851
- I felt like some of the throws in early,

00:03:46.851 --> 00:03:49.103
we were going low and to the right.
- Right.

00:03:49.103 --> 00:03:51.105
- When did it start clicking for you?

00:03:51.981 --> 00:03:52.941
- Probably about after the third throw.

00:03:52.941 --> 00:03:56.152
Had to get in a rhythm,
but definitely was a little to the right.

00:03:56.152 --> 00:03:57.320
Had to pick it up a little bit.

00:03:57.320 --> 00:03:59.405
- This man has been writing notes.

00:03:59.405 --> 00:04:01.658
He has been very meticulous.

00:04:01.658 --> 00:04:04.202
So, Clint, are you ready?

00:04:04.202 --> 00:04:04.744
- I'm ready.

00:04:04.744 --> 00:04:06.746
- OK. Come over here.

00:04:07.288 --> 00:04:08.706
Give me some shade.

00:04:08.706 --> 00:04:09.290
- Sorry.

00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:13.294
- Let me just get your overall feel of what we saw.
- Actually, pretty accurate.

00:04:13.294 --> 00:04:15.380
D'Andre, you were able to hit every target,
and you didn't

00:04:15.380 --> 00:04:19.217
hit 'em all on the first drive, but you hit every target.
- [Lefkoe:] Man. OK.

00:04:19.467 --> 00:04:23.096
We wanted to improve his throwing ratings.
- Throw accuracy short,

00:04:23.096 --> 00:04:25.473
because all the passes we made
today were 

00:04:25.473 --> 00:04:27.809
of the short variety—
- The short throws, yep.

00:04:27.809 --> 00:04:32.188
- That's actually going up five points
from a 30 to a 35.

00:04:32.313 --> 00:04:35.358
That puts you inside of the top 40 for all
NFL running backs.

00:04:35.358 --> 00:04:37.485
That's a bump of 13 spots.

00:04:37.485 --> 00:04:38.861
- Progress, I guess. Progress.

00:04:38.861 --> 00:04:39.779
- And more importantly,

00:04:39.779 --> 00:04:44.659
now I get to ask you
the question: Was D'Andre Swift underrated?

00:04:44.742 --> 00:04:48.538
- D'Andre Swift was underrated in passing.
- Appreciate that.

00:04:49.580 --> 00:04:52.125
Appreciate that.

